# Owner-specific denylist for scripts/scan_secrets.py
#
# COPY this file to `.scan_denylist.local` and add your OWN real names,
# companies, domains and infrastructure IPs, one per line. That local file is
# git-ignored and MUST NEVER be committed, so your real personal data stays out
# of version control while the scanner still guards against it leaking into the
# rest of the repo.
#
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored. Matching is
# case-insensitive substring.
#
# Examples (replace with your real values in .scan_denylist.local):
# your-company-gmbh
# your-domain.example
# yourname
# 203.0.113.7
